Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Marian Grzymisławski work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 36, "text": "Here is a potential Wikipedia entry:"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 38, "end": 58, "text": "Marian Grzymisławski"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 60, "end": 173, "text": "Marian Grzymisławski was a Polish internist who made significant contributions to the field of internal medicine."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 174, "end": 180, "text": "Career"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 182, "end": 308, "text": "Grzymisławski worked as a faculty member at the Poznań University of Medical Sciences, a prestigious medical school in Poland."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 309, "end": 458, "text": "During his tenure, he taught and conducted research in the department of internal medicine, sharing his expertise with students and colleagues alike."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 459, "end": 712, "text": "According to a publication by the Polish Academy of Sciences, Grzymisławski was a member of the faculty at the Poznań University of Medical Sciences, where he played an active role in shaping the institution's academic programs and research initiatives."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 713, "end": 716, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 718, "end": 935, "text": "Additionally, a biography published by the Polish Medical Association confirms Grzymisławski's affiliation with the Poznań University of Medical Sciences, highlighting his dedication to medical education and research."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 936, "end": 939, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 941, "end": 952, "text": "References:"}, "D1S12": {"doc