t": 310, "end": 373, "text": "Grzymisławski was born in Warsaw, Poland, on February 12, 1955."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 374, "end": 460, "text": "He pursued his medical degree at the Medical University of Warsaw, graduating in 1980."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 461, "end": 583, "text": "Following his graduation, Grzymisławski completed his residency in internal medicine at the University Hospital of Warsaw."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 584, "end": 590, "text": "Career"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 592, "end": 731, "text": "Grzymisławski's academic career began in 1985 when he joined the University of Warsaw as a lecturer in the Department of Internal Medicine."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 732, "end": 862, "text": "During his tenure, he published several papers on cardiovascular disease and hypertension, which garnered international attention."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 863, "end": 896, "text": "University of Reading (1990-1995)"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 898, "end": 1044, "text": "In 1990, Grzymisławski was appointed as a visiting professor at the University of Reading, where he worked in the Department of Clinical Medicine."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1045, "end": 1202, "text": "During his five-year tenure, he collaborated with British researchers on several projects, including a study on the effects of diet on cardiovascular health."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1203, "end": 1206, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1208, "end": 1424, "text": "One of Grzymisławski's most notable contributions during this period was his involvement in the Reading Heart Study, a longitudinal study examining the risk factors for cardiovascular disease in the local population."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1425, "end": 1587, "text": "[2] The study's findings, published in the British Medical Journal in 1993, highlighted the importance of early intervention in preventing cardiovascular disease."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1588, "end": 1591, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1593, "end": 1722, "text": "Grzymisławski's work at the University of Reading earned him an honorary fellowship from the Royal College of Physicians in 1994."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1723, "end": 1735, "text": "Later Career"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1737, "end": 1873, "text": "After leaving the University of Reading in 1995, Grzymisławski returned to Poland, where he continued to work as a consultant internist."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1874, "end": 2012, "text": "He has since published numerous papers on various aspects of internal medicine and has been recognized for his contributions to the field."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2013, "end": 2023, "text": "References"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2025, "end": 2054, "text": "[1] Grzymisławski, M., et al."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2055, "end": 2062, "text": "(1992)."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2063, "end": 2138, "text": "\"Dietary patterns and cardiovascular risk factors in a British population.\""}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2139, "end": 2194, "text": "European Journal of Clinical Nutrition, 46(2), 131-138."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2195, "end": 2225, "text": "[2] Reading Heart Study Group."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2226, "end": 2233, "text": "(1993)."}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id"